3. WHAT IS NOT INCLUDED BUT IS REQUIRED TO BUILD
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The firmware builds against ESP-IDF, which is not vendored here and carries
its own licences. Installing it pulls in, among others:

  ESP-IDF and its components   Apache-2.0    Espressif Systems
  FreeRTOS                     MIT           Amazon Web Services
  newlib / toolchain           BSD-family    various
  mbedTLS                      Apache-2.0    The Mbed TLS Contributors

The PC deck requires Python packages installed separately (aiohttp, numpy,
soundcard, winsdk), each under its own licence. tools/movies/ optionally uses
Pillow (HPND) for GIF import and preview export; the 3D renderer itself uses
only the Python standard library.

Nothing in this list is redistributed by this repository. Building or running
the project obtains them from their own sources, under their own terms.

