4. NETWORK SERVICES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The deck can query two public services, both optional and both disabled by a
single flag:

  LRCLIB              https://lrclib.net                    synced lyrics
  iTunes Search API   https://itunes.apple.com/search       album art fallback

Requests carry only the track title, artist and album. No audio is transmitted
anywhere, ever. Neither service is operated by or affiliated with this project,
neither is under any obligation to remain available, and each has its own terms
which the user of this software is responsible for observing.

